      "en": "$tscxc_thres5"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Represents the RFR (revenu fiscal de référence) threshold for one fiscal share separating the median ('taux médian') CSG band from the top rate on pension income; latest value €26,472/year. Its time series holds only 9 recorded values (versus 20 for the exemption threshold and 13 for the reduced-rate threshold), suggesting this median-rate band was introduced later than the others. It is used in tinty_fr's ArithOp (Formula) commented 'Calculate applicable threshold for median rate for pensions', paired with $tscxc_thres6 for the per-half-share increment, consistent with the theme documentation's description of an income-varying CSG rate on pensions (Table 2.65)."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Parameters for determining net taxable income (RNI)"
    },
